护与失效分析等。\n\n工作任务Task：\n（1）与客户沟通产品技术问题，输出对应技术文件，编撰需求说明书，详细设计说明书等；\n（2）针对客户的整机系统框架进行优化设计，包括机构优化，cable走线规划。 \n（3）协助PM、工厂进行生产，解决试产过程中出现的技术问题，以及客诉问题；\n（4）旧机种维护及失效分析；\n（5）协助客户实时解决问题；","Require":"专业知识与技能Professional Knowledge and skill：\n（1）熟悉x86或ARM工控机的系统架构, 能看懂电路工作原理和layout；\n（2）熟悉常用的硬件、设备的接口和通信协议，有硬件或设备的相关开发经验优先\n（3）能借助工具进行设备故障排除，正确判断故障原因，熟悉大型精密测量设备者优先。\n（4）英语流利，能作为工作语言；\n\n联系方Contact：\n（1）External：客户；\n（2）Internal：制造中心、PSM&PM、Sales团队；\n\n工作经验与教育背景Experience and Education：\n（1）三年以上硬件开发或技术支持相关工作经验；优秀硕士应届毕业生亦可件。\n（2）电子、机械电子、电气自动化相关专业本科以上学历\n\n语言要求Language：\n英语四级，口语和读写流利，英语六级者优先。\n\n其他Others：\n良好的团队协作精神，个性积极主动，对技术有浓厚兴趣和专研精神。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":"昆山协同研发中心","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-30T11:18:53","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fead6